usage: csk global [-h]
                  {init,add,remove,list,status,install,update,upgrade} ...

positional arguments:
  {init,add,remove,list,status,install,update,upgrade}
    init                create ~/.cocoaskills/global/Skillfile.json
    add                 add or replace a global skill declaration
    remove              remove a global skill declaration
    list                list declared global skills
    status              show global installed state
    install             install global skills
    update              fetch global skill source repositories
    upgrade             fetch global skill sources, then install

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit

Global scope:
  Uses ~/.cocoaskills/global/Skillfile.json and installs adapters into user-level agent dirs.

Examples:
  csk global init
  csk global add skill-metrics --git git@example.com:skills/skill-metrics.git --tag v1.0.0
  csk global install
  csk global install --only skill-metrics
  csk global upgrade
